==Battleground==
*4 [[Metal Doge]]s spawn after 6.67 seconds<sup>200f</sup>, delay 56.67~60 seconds<sup>1,700f~1,800f</sup>.
*Infinite [[Cerberus Kids]] spawn after 10 seconds<sup>300f</sup>, delay 23.33~26.67 seconds<sup>700f~800f</sup>.
*1 [[Wicked Axe Cat (Enemy)|Wicked Axe Cat]] spawns as the boss after 20 seconds<sup>600f</sup>.
*5 [[Aku Doge]]s spawn after 53.33 seconds<sup>1,600f</sup>, delay 53.33~56.67 seconds<sup>1,600f~1,700f</sup>.
*6 [[Jackie Peng]]s spawn after 73.33 seconds<sup>2,200f</sup>, delay 26.67~30 seconds<sup>800f~900f</sup>.

==Strategy==
Use the same strategy as the previous stage, [[Aku's Nest]]. This time, [[Aku Gory]] is replaced with a buffed Jackie Peng, which is much easier to deal with. The Metal Doges will get killed by your meatshields, since they have a small amount of health. Another option would be to bring a [[:Category:Critical Hit Cats|Critical Hitter]] such as [[Catornado (Super Rare Cat)|Hurricat]] to deal with them.

Another strategy you could try, if the former doesn't work, is using two or three Defense UP Sm [[Cat Combo|Combos]] like [[Étoile minimum (Combo)|Étoile minimum]] and [[Little Warriors (Combo)|Little Warriors]] along with [[Tank Cat (Normal Cat)|dual]] [[Crazed Tank Cat (Super Rare Cat)|Erasers]] and [[Lizard Cat (Normal Cat)|King Dragon Cat]]. units such as [[Radiant Aphrodite (Uber Rare Cat)|Megaphrodite]] and [[Sea Serpent Daliasan (Uber Rare Cat)|Sea King Daliasan]] or almost any other [[:Category:Uber Rare Cats|Uber]] unit that outranges Wicked Axe Cat can be used to deal large amounts of damage. [[:Category:Shield Piercing Cats|Shield Piercers]] can also be helpful (so long as they can live long enough to land a hit). If you do not have any long-range Ubers, then you could use [[Crazed Lizard Cat (Super Rare Cat)|Crazed Dragon Cat]] instead.

==Trivia==
*The Devil War is named like [[Manic Dark Cat (Enemy)|Manic Dark Cat]]'s stage, [[Unjust War (Deadly)|Unjust War]], but contains [[Wicked Axe Cat (Enemy)|Wicked Axe Cat]], while [[Hyperberserker (Merciless)|Hyperberserker]] is named like [[Crazed Axe Cat (Enemy)|Crazed Axe Cat]]'s stage, [[Berserk (Insane)|Berserk]], but contains [[Malevolent Dark Cat]].

